{"id":"aed1d844fad5cccf","group":"20","path":"20/20-thm-superlow-basis.md","title":"Superlow Basis Theorem","display":"thm-superlow-basis — Superlow Basis Theorem","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-thm-superlow-basis","aliases":["20-thm-superlow-basis"],"display":"thm-superlow-basis — Superlow Basis Theorem","chapter":"9","section":"9.4","source_kind":"book","verification_status":"proved-in-note","source_reference":"Theorem 9.4.2","source_pdf_pages":[209,210],"source_printed_pages":[177,178],"depends_on":["[[20-df-superlow]]","[[20-df-closed-class]]","[[20-df-nce]]","[[20-df-oracle-stage-evaluation]]","[[20-thm-cantor-compactness]]","[[20-thm-omega-ce]]","[[20-df-computable]]","[[20-thm-jump]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-thm-superlow-basis"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-thm-superlow-basis</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-superlow-basis — Superlow Basis Theorem"},{"key":"chapter","html":"9"},{"key":"section","html":"9.4"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Theorem 9.4.2"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>209</span><span>210</span></div>"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>177</span><span>178</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"948261c4fe40ffdc\" href=\"?note=948261c4fe40ffdc\" title=\"20-df-superlow\">20-df-superlow</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b73290a0af01d44f\" href=\"?note=b73290a0af01d44f\" title=\"20-df-closed-class\">20-df-closed-class</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"f6085a9e9511e00a\" href=\"?note=f6085a9e9511e00a\" title=\"20-df-nce\">20-df-nce</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"01d522a0b0df3738\" href=\"?note=01d522a0b0df3738\" title=\"20-df-oracle-stage-evaluation\">20-df-oracle-stage-evaluation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"84785d7ea3ad1a08\" href=\"?note=84785d7ea3ad1a08\" title=\"20-thm-cantor-compactness\">20-thm-cantor-compactness</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"c209552a90f2623f\" href=\"?note=c209552a90f2623f\" title=\"20-thm-omega-ce\">20-thm-omega-ce</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"e343870c773cb68e\" href=\"?note=e343870c773cb68e\" title=\"20-df-computable\">20-df-computable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"2ea8548c98f572c3\" href=\"?note=2ea8548c98f572c3\" title=\"20-thm-jump\">20-thm-jump</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C=[T]\\ne\\varnothing\">\\(C=[T]\\ne\\varnothing\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 可计算；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U_e=\\{\\sigma:\\Phi_{e,|\\sigma|}^{\\sigma}(e)\\uparrow\\}\">\\(U_e=\\{\\sigma:\\Phi_{e,|\\sigma|}^{\\sigma}(e)\\uparrow\\}\\)</span>。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C_2^{\\mathrm{tot}}\">\\(\\mathcal C_2^{\\mathrm{tot}}\\)</span> 为全可计算二元函数族。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"948261c4fe40ffdc\" href=\"?note=948261c4fe40ffdc\" title=\"20-df-superlow\">20-df-superlow</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"b73290a0af01d44f\" href=\"?note=b73290a0af01d44f\" title=\"20-df-closed-class\">20-df-closed-class</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"f6085a9e9511e00a\" href=\"?note=f6085a9e9511e00a\" title=\"20-df-nce\">20-df-nce</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"01d522a0b0df3738\" href=\"?note=01d522a0b0df3738\" title=\"20-df-oracle-stage-evaluation\">20-df-oracle-stage-evaluation</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-13\" data-note=\"84785d7ea3ad1a08\" href=\"?note=84785d7ea3ad1a08\" title=\"20-thm-cantor-compactness\">20-thm-cantor-compactness</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-14\" data-note=\"c209552a90f2623f\" href=\"?note=c209552a90f2623f\" title=\"20-thm-omega-ce\">20-thm-omega-ce</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-15\" data-note=\"e343870c773cb68e\" href=\"?note=e343870c773cb68e\" title=\"20-df-computable\">20-df-computable</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-16\" data-note=\"2ea8548c98f572c3\" href=\"?note=2ea8548c98f572c3\" title=\"20-thm-jump\">20-thm-jump</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}superlow-basis}\\vdash\n\\exists X\\in C\\ \\exists b\\in\\mathcal C_2^{\\mathrm{tot}}\\ \\left[\\begin{gathered}\n\\operatorname{Superlow}(X)\\land\\forall e,s\\ b(e,s)\\in2,\\\\\n\\forall e\\ \\left(b(e,0)=0\\land\\lim_s b(e,s)=X&#39;(e)\\land\n|\\{s:b(e,s+1)\\ne b(e,s)\\}|\\le2^{e+1}\\right)\n\\end{gathered}\\right].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}superlow-basis}\\vdash\n\\exists X\\in C\\ \\exists b\\in\\mathcal C_2^{\\mathrm{tot}}\\ \\left[\\begin{gathered}\n\\operatorname{Superlow}(X)\\land\\forall e,s\\ b(e,s)\\in2,\\\\\n\\forall e\\ \\left(b(e,0)=0\\land\\lim_s b(e,s)=X&#39;(e)\\land\n|\\{s:b(e,s+1)\\ne b(e,s)\\}|\\le2^{e+1}\\right)\n\\end{gathered}\\right].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>在阶段 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\\ge1\">\\(s\\ge1\\)</span>，置 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T_{0,s}=T\">\\(T_{0,s}=T\\)</span>，依次处理 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e&lt;s\">\\(e&lt;s\\)</span>：若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T_{e,s}\\cap U_e\">\\(T_{e,s}\\cap U_e\\)</span> 有长度 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\">\\(s\\)</span> 的节点，置 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b(e,s)=0\">\\(b(e,s)=0\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T_{e+1,s}=T_{e,s}\\cap U_e\">\\(T_{e+1,s}=T_{e,s}\\cap U_e\\)</span>；否则置 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b(e,s)=1\">\\(b(e,s)=1\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T_{e+1,s}=T_{e,s}\">\\(T_{e+1,s}=T_{e,s}\\)</span>。对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e\\ge s\">\\(e\\ge s\\)</span> 暂置 0。所有检验都是有限检验，各选择后的树仍有第 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\">\\(s\\)</span> 层。</p>\n<p>固定低于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e\">\\(e\\)</span> 的选择向量后，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T_{e,s}\">\\(T_{e,s}\\)</span> 是同一棵树；黑选择只可能因某个有限空层被看到而变一次白选择，此后不再变回。阶段间第一个改变的选择必为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\\to1\">\\(0\\to1\\)</span>，所以前 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e\">\\(e\\)</span> 位选择向量按字典序递增，至多经历 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"2^e\">\\(2^e\\)</span> 个区间。在每个区间第 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e\">\\(e\\)</span> 位至多一次 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\\to1\">\\(0\\to1\\)</span>，区间间至多一次重置 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1\\to0\">\\(1\\to0\\)</span>，连同首次激活，改变界不超过 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"2^{e+1}\">\\(2^{e+1}\\)</span>。归纳可见每位稳定。</p>\n<p>令稳定后的树为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T_e\">\\(T_e\\)</span>。黑稳定当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T_e\\cap U_e\">\\(T_e\\cap U_e\\)</span> 无限；白稳定时交树有限。故所有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T_e\">\\(T_e\\)</span> 无限且嵌套，紧致性给某个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> 属于全部路径类，并且稳定选择 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b(e)\">\\(b(e)\\)</span> 恰是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X&#39;(e)\">\\(X&#39;(e)\\)</span>。这给有可计算改变界的跳跃近似，不要求所选路径近似本身有同一改变界。由 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span>-c.e. 表征，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X&#39;\\le_{tt}\\varnothing&#39;\">\\(X&#39;\\le_{tt}\\varnothing&#39;\\)</span>，并由 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\le_TX&#39;\">\\(X\\le_TX&#39;\\)</span> 得 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\le_T\\varnothing&#39;\">\\(X\\le_T\\varnothing&#39;\\)</span>，即 Superlow。</p>\n<p>来源：Theorem 9.4.2；印刷 177–178 / PDF 209–210。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-superlow","status":"resolved","id":"948261c4fe40ffdc","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-superlow]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-closed-class","status":"resolved","id":"b73290a0af01d44f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-closed-class]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-nce","status":"resolved","id":"f6085a9e9511e00a","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-nce]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-oracle-stage-evaluation","status":"resolved","id":"01d522a0b0df3738","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-oracle-stage-evaluation]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-cantor-compactness","status":"resolved","id":"84785d7ea3ad1a08","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-thm-cantor-compactness]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-omega-ce","status":"resolved","id":"c209552a90f2623f","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-thm-omega-ce]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-computable","status":"resolved","id":"e343870c773cb68e","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-computable]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-jump","status":"resolved","id":"2ea8548c98f572