},{"tex":"s","display":false},{"tex":"b(e,s)=0","display":false},{"tex":"T_{e+1,s}=T_{e,s}\\cap U_e","display":false},{"tex":"b(e,s)=1","display":false},{"tex":"T_{e+1,s}=T_{e,s}","display":false},{"tex":"e\\ge s","display":false},{"tex":"s","display":false},{"tex":"e","display":false},{"tex":"T_{e,s}","display":false},{"tex":"0\\to1","display":false},{"tex":"e","display":false},{"tex":"2^e","display":false},{"tex":"e","display":false},{"tex":"0\\to1","display":false},{"tex":"1\\to0","display":false},{"tex":"2^{e+1}","display":false},{"tex":"T_e","display":false},{"tex":"T_e\\cap U_e","display":false},{"tex":"T_e","display":false},{"tex":"X","display":false},{"tex":"b(e)","display":false},{"tex":"X'(e)","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"X'\\le_{tt}\\varnothing'","display":false},{"tex":"X\\le_TX'","display":false},{"tex":"X\\le_T\\varnothing'","display":false}],"bytes":2687,"backlinks":[{"id":"f3d166954d8948f4","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-cor-random-closed-class]]；see [[20-thm-superlow-basis]]。"},{"id":"15cf85fd84eaf3f9","anchor":"ref-51","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"既有路线可继续阅读：动态枚举 [[20-thm-friedberg-dynamic-splitting]]；反演与精确对 [[20-lem-shoenfield-inversion-set]]、[[20-thm-exact-pair]]；有限损伤 [[20-thm-low-simple]]、[[20-thm-fm]]、[[20-thm-sacks-splitting]]；Δ₂ 扩展 [[20-thm-delta2-cone-avoidance]]、[[20-thm-countable-delta2-splitting]]；基定理 [[20-thm-low-basis]]、[[20-thm-superlow-basis]]；博弈 [[20-thm-banach-mazur]]、[[20-thm-open-winning-strategy-compiler]]、[[20-thm-no-total-open-strategy-selection]]。"}],"outgoing":["948261c4fe40ffdc","b73290a0af01d44f","f6085a9e9511e00a","01d522a0b0df3738","84785d7ea3ad1a08","c209552a90f2623f","e343870c773cb68e","2ea8548c98f572c3"]}